# Cloudflare Pages redirects (docs/ops/web-hosting.md). kob.kaspa.ag/indexer was the canary's indexer relay (and the default
# indexer of older `kob` builds); the same keyless indexer is now https://kob-api.kaspa.ag. 308 keeps the method and body.
# For bookmarks and clients that follow redirects: WebSocket clients and `kob` itself do not, so an older `kob` needs
# --indexer https://kob-api.kaspa.ag (or KOB_INDEXER_URL).
/indexer    https://kob-api.kaspa.ag/        308
/indexer/*  https://kob-api.kaspa.ag/:splat  308
